    "detailed_description": "Step into the boots of a fire lookout in this atmospheric first-person horror game. Armed with only a flashlight and a pump-action shotgun, you must survive the eerie and unpredictable alien threat lurking in the shadows. Uncover the dark secrets and unravel the mystery behind the strange happenings out in the wilderness. Can you survive the unknown?<br><br>Venture through the wilderness, abandoned bunkers, and more to uncover the secrets of the mysterious alien presence lurking nearby.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114040/extras/434872debff20ede9be0508b3e4cc053.poster.avif?t=1721868408\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114040/extras/434872debff20ede9be0508b3e4cc053.webm?t=1721868408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114040/extras/434872debff20ede9be0508b3e4cc053.mp4?t=1721868408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Through discovered audio logs and radio communication uncover the stories and events of nearby individuals and witnesses to the strange happenings in the area.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114040/extras/aed45d8b7458abccfc0c37e4e3867249.poster.avif?t=1721868408\" width=608 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114040/extras/aed45d8b7458abccfc0c37e4e3867249.webm?t=1721868408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114040/extras/aed45d8b7458abccfc0c37e4e3867249.mp4?t=1721868408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Survive and escape: Defend yourself from alien thre